CDS view 
CDS view in abap stands for CORE DATA SERVICES are the next generation database views
CDS Data model go beyond the capabilities of the DDIC Views. E.g you can define viwes that aggreagate an analyse data in a layered fashion. 
It pushes data from Apllication layer to database layer.
SAP S/4 HANA te next generation business suite, is also based on CDS in the form of VIRTUAL DATA MODEL VDM.
Code pushdown 
Delegating data intense calculations to the database layer. Eg Add balances of a customers saving account 
ABAP developer traditionally used layered approach for development.
with pushdown technology the business logic is pushed to the database layer.
Eg Want to retrive Sales order which matches certain condition then write a function module/class/any other ABAP object which goes to the database layer 
